== 交叉验证: hwprobe vs /proc/cpuinfo isa ==
  cpuinfo isa: rv64imafdch_zicntr_zicsr_zifencei_zihpm_zba_zbb_sscofpmf
  [不一致] fd         hwprobe=present cpuinfo=absent   ← 配置漂移，需追查
  [一致] c            hwprobe=present cpuinfo=present
  [一致] v            hwprobe=absent  cpuinfo=absent
  [一致] zba          hwprobe=present cpuinfo=present
  [一致] zbb          hwprobe=present cpuinfo=present
  [一致] zbs          hwprobe=absent  cpuinfo=absent
